{
  "layer": "requirements",
  "type": "requirement",
  "name": "project-templates",
  "body": "Project templates: every kalide project defines its own templates and assets (slide/section templates, themes, fonts, logos and any other media such as video) in a `templates/` directory at the project root, alongside `slides/`, `assets/` and `kalide.yaml`. The binary ships none (no fallback). Parent of the project-templates feature.",
